                                                "example_id": "ecd54cc3-144c-4518-9def-4406a84dcc2a",
                                                "sense_id": "d0293838-1a5f-3c18-a295-38431a619119",
                                                "text": "In his autography, The Age of Turbulence, released by Penguin Press in September 2007—ironically, a few days before the second rate cut of the year—Greenspan says he thought it was wrong to increase scrutiny of subprime mortgages."
